      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The neighborhood’s homes are mostly American Foursquare, with Queen Anne and Prairie School touches that give Andersonville its classic look.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
